{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghuxEnoWsVmytEMwHPGC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The split now shows: the chosen branch continues left of the car, the gore and the right-hand ground appear, and the car sits on its branch. The \"decided\" frame is past the switch to S2 and is fine. Next I'll record the engine changes, and I'll check the engine's unit-level tests still pass."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_read_input_tokens":748777,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f95c51ac-ca98-4f0d-bbff-431b6595447e","uuid":"f0c6b17c-b4f3-427f-8c79-5e00f2fef92d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:48:10.334Z","request_id":"req_011CghuxEHoAxvVQuWkhuuDg"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghuxEnoWsVmytEMwHPGC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YFmqeomuL8EJ8ei4QX1kQ7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"diff <(cat .cache/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js) engine/my-3d2dge.js | grep \"^[<>]\" | wc -l && cat > engine/CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes (my-3d2dge v0.85.2, commit 4390a98, file engine/my-3d2dge.js)\n\nEvery change is listed here with what and why. The game's own code is in src/; these are the changes made to the engine\nfile itself (the plan's E-numbers are kept).\n\n- **E3 analog input.** `Input.analog(action)` returns the largest pressure among the pad buttons bound to the action (a\n  trigger's value), 1 for a held key or button, else 0. Why: throttle and brake on R2 and L2 must be progressive.\n- **E4 hub corner guard.** `Input.hubCorner()` is true while Create is held on the controller in use, in an AI Hub\n  session. The pause checks (`Game` and the split-screen players) skip Options while it is true. Why: the protocol reserves\n  Create + Options for the hub's corner bar.\n- **E5 glyph default.** `Input.glyphs` starts as `'playstation'` (was `'auto'`). Why: PlayStation symbols by default.\n- **E7 continuous voices.** `Audio.loop(spec)` runs an oscillator (or noise, through an optional filter) until `stop()`;\n  `set({ freq, gain, cutoff }, seconds)` moves it. It sits on the sound-effects bus and goes quiet while the game is\n  paused; nothing plays headless. Why: an engine note and a tyre squeal need a sound that keeps going.\n\nNot made (game code instead, or not used by the game):\n- **E1 junction roads**: the fork renderer is game code (src/43-fork.js, OB.drawStage), built on the engine's road\n  internals (`_p`, `_thing`, `seg`, `yAt`); the engine's road.js is unchanged.\n- **E2 road dressing, E6 synth fields, E8 shell theme**: not made. The game does not use E.Shell's theme.\nEOF\necho written","description":"Confirm the engine diff size and write the engine changes log"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":906,"cache_read_input_tokens":748777,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":906},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f95c51ac-ca98-4f0d-bbff-431b6595447e","uuid":"b98f9583-6733-4898-b29c-43f31201d40c","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:48:14.897Z","request_id":"req_011CghuxEHoAxvVQuWkhuuDg","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01YFmqeomuL8EJ8ei4QX1kQ7":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-043153__xe1b7e1/work/OutBloom2006Coast2Coast-OutRun2006Coast2Coast-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-043153 && diff <(cat .cache/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff/my-3d2dge.js) engine/my-3d2dge.js | grep \"^[<>]\" | wc -l && cat > engine/CHANGES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine changes (my-3d2dge v0.85.2, commit 4390a98, file engine/my-3d2dge.js)\n\nEvery change is listed here with what and why. The game's own code is in src/; these are the changes made to the engine\nfile itself (the plan's E-numbers are kept).\n\n- **E3 analog input.** `Input.analog(action)` returns the largest pressure among the pad buttons bound to the action (a\n  trigger's value), 1 for a held key or button, else 0. Why: throttle and brake on R2 and L2 must be progressive.\n- **E4 hub corner guard.** `Input.hubCorner()` is true while Create is held on the controller in use, in an AI Hub\n  session. The pause checks (`Game` and the split-screen players) skip Options while it is true. Why: the protocol reserves\n  Create + Options for the hub's corner bar.\n- **E5 glyph default.** `Input.glyphs` starts as `'playstation'` (was `'auto'`). Why: PlayStation symbols by default.\n- **E7 continuous voices.** `Audio.loop(spec)` runs an oscillator (or noise, through an optional filter) until `stop()`;\n  `set({ freq, gain, cutoff }, seconds)` moves it. It sits on the sound-effects bus and goes quiet while the game is\n  paused; nothing plays headless. Why: an engine note and a tyre squeal need a sound that keeps going.\n\nNot made (game code instead, or not used by the game):\n- **E1 junction roads**: the fork renderer is game code (src/43-fork.js, OB.drawStage), built on the engine's road\n  internals (`_p`, `_thing`, `seg`, `yAt`); the engine's road.js is unchanged.\n- **E2 road dressing, E6 synth fields, E8 shell theme**: not made. The game does not use E.Shell's theme.\nEOF\necho written","description":"Confirm the engine diff size and write the engine changes log"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01YFmqeomuL8EJ8ei4QX1kQ7":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-043153__xe1b7e1/work/OutBloom2006Coast2Coast-OutRun2006Coast2Coast-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-043153"}}}
