{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghvjxfiVx28pcasUcsKg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XCD2k7CVUq6S59ubyd7HFF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('engine/CHANGES.md').read()\ns=s.replace(\"- **E2 road dressing, E6 synth fields**: not made.\\n\",\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"Not made (game code instead, or not used by the game):\",\"\"\"- **E2 road dressing.** `Road.dressBand(g, vp, s, p1, p2, alt)`, called from the band between the grass and the road: a\n  segment's `groundL` / `groundR` (a colour, or [a, b] by the row), `edgeL` / `edgeR` (`{ kind: 'rail' | 'wall' | 'cliff' |\n  'hedge' | 'facade' | 'stonewall', h }`, standing on the asphalt's edge) and `span` (`{ kind: 'arch' | 'canopy' | 'bunting' |\n  'gallery' | 'snowshed', h }`, across the road). Why: sea and cliffs beside the road, rails on bridges, walls and spans.\n- **E6 synth extension.** Tracks may set `inst` (the presets in `INSTS`: epiano, slapbass, fingerbass, brass, stab,\n  steeldrum, marimba, lead, sax, pad, organ, pluck, chorusgtr) and a note may be a chord (`C4+E4+G4`), an accent (`C4!`)\n  or a slide (`C4~`, gliding to the next note). Voices take `unison` (detuned copies, `detune` cents), `fm` ({ ratio,\n  index, decay }), `filter` ({ type, f, q }) and `pan`. The drum kit adds p (clap), r (rim), g and G (congas), b (cowbell),\n  z (shaker), m (timbale), y (ride) and T (high tom). Not made: the effects bus (`send`, the convolution reverb).\n\nNot made (game code instead, or not used by the game):\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"- **E1 junction roads**\",\"- **E1 junction roads**\")\nopen('engine/CHANGES.md','w').write(s)\nn=open('NOTES.md').read()\ni=n.index('## Deviations from the plan'); j=n.index('## Verified')\nn=n[:i]+\"\"\"## Deviations from the plan (what is still not the plan's)\n- Stage layouts are 80% of the plan's length (the plan's stage lengths and speed model disagree); stage pars are the bot's times.\n- Clock: start 100 s, checkpoint bonus 71 s (plan: 75 and 57). Bot: every route finishes on the default clock.\n- Forks: game code (src/43-fork.js, OB.drawStage), on the road module's internals; the branches continue as their stages.\n- Rivals are pacers that collide with the car; versus is two races whose cars collide when they meet.\n- Tour map: an island with the pyramid, pins and pinned postcards (cards overlap where stages share pins).\n- Passengers: Humanoid rigs (portraits and seated in the car). In the car the legs show over the body (one draw pass).\n- Art: px drawing in code, no pre-rendered sprites or shape pipeline.\n- Audio: songs and jingles on the engine synth with the E6 presets, chords, accents and slides; the effects bus (send, reverb) is not built.\n- Engine changes: E2, E3, E4, E5, E6 (partly), E7, E8 (engine/CHANGES.md). E1 is game code.\n- Hub: ghost mode (the plan's §7.12 choice). Shared-world mode is not built; TASK.md asks for multiplayer integration, which ghost mode provides.\n- Attract: a timed playlist of bot runs, endings and the high-score table (about 100 s a cycle).\n\n\"\"\"+n[j:]\nopen('NOTES.md','w').write(n); print('ok')\nEOF\necho done","description":"Update the engine change log and the notes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1481,"cache_read_input_tokens":812743,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1481},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f95c51ac-ca98-4f0d-bbff-431b6595447e","uuid":"1f78273a-6e8c-4647-93c2-340a0e845f0e","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:58:32.255Z","request_id":"req_011CghvjxDSZW5pR7LW5VBbp","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01XCD2k7CVUq6S59ubyd7HFF":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/c