 57). Bot: every route finishes on the default clock.\n- Forks: game code (src/43-fork.js, OB.drawStage), on the road module's internals; the branches continue as their stages.\n- Rivals are pacers that collide with the car; versus is two races whose cars collide when they meet.\n- Tour map: an island with the pyramid, pins and pinned postcards (cards overlap where stages share pins).\n- Passengers: Humanoid rigs (portraits and seated in the car). In the car the legs show over the body (one draw pass).\n- Art: px drawing in code, no pre-rendered sprites or shape pipeline.\n- Audio: songs and jingles on the engine synth with the E6 presets, chords, accents and slides; the effects bus (send, reverb) is not built.\n- Engine changes: E2, E3, E4, E5, E6 (partly), E7, E8 (engine/CHANGES.md). E1 is game code.\n- Hub: ghost mode (the plan's §7.12 choice). Shared-world mode is not built; TASK.md asks for multiplayer integration, which ghost mode provides.\n- Attract: a timed playlist of bot runs, endings and the high-score table (about 100 s a cycle).\n\n\"\"\"+n[j:]\nopen('NOTES.md','w').write(n); print('ok')\nEOF\necho done","description":"Update the engine change log and the notes"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01XCD2k7CVUq6S59ubyd7HFF":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-043153__xe1b7e1/work/OutBloom2006Coast2Coast-OutRun2006Coast2Coast-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-043153"}}}
