{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghvvSstYgvwbDeCXRcGz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have the routing points. The engine's track gains connect to the music bus, so each track can take a send. The sound-effect path picks its bus in one place, so a voice bus can go there. I'll add to the audio class: a tempo-synced delay and a convolution reverb built from a generated impulse, per-track send amounts, `reverb(amount, fade)`, and a voice bus with its own volume."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3094,"cache_read_input_tokens":820336,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3094},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f95c51ac-ca98-4f0d-bbff-431b6595447e","uuid":"9283b238-be07-4517-919b-efd6aec8b27d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:00:53.763Z","request_id":"req_011CghvvSPcYUsEYUBpbTHic"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghvvSstYgvwbDeCXRcGz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PwKV7a5PRTjUGfZTvZQJJc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-043153__xe1b7e1/work/OutBloom2006Coast2Coast-OutRun2006Coast2Coast-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-043153 && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='engine/my-3d2dge.js'; s=open(p).read()\ndef rep(a,b):\n    global s\n    c=s.count(a); assert c==1,(c,a[:90]); s=s.replace(a,b)\nrep(\"      this._musBus = c.createGain(); this._musBus.connect(this._master);\\n\",\n\"\"\"      this._musBus = c.createGain(); this._musBus.connect(this._master);\n      // (E6) the voice bus (its own volume, for the speech) and the effects: a delay at a 3/16 note and a convolution\n      // reverb from a generated impulse, each fed by a track's send, both returned to the music bus\n      this._voiceBus = c.createGain(); this._voiceBus.connect(this._master);\n      this._dIn = c.createGain(); this._rIn = c.createGain(); this._fxOut = c.createGain(); this._fxOut.connect(this._musBus);\n      this._delay = c.createDelay(2); this._delay.delayTime.value = .375; const fb = c.createGain(); fb.gain.value = .35;\n      this._dIn.connect(this._delay); this._delay.connect(fb); fb.connect(this._delay); this._delay.connect(this._fxOut);\n      const imp = c.createBuffer(2, Math.floor(c.sampleRate * 1.8), c.sampleRate);\n      for (let ch = 0; ch < 2; ch++) { const d = imp.getChannelData(ch); for (let i = 0; i < d.length; i++) d[i] = (Math.random() * 2 - 1) * Math.pow(1 - i / d.length, 3); }\n      this._conv = c.createConvolver(); this._conv.buffer = imp; this._wet = c.createGain(); this._wet.gain.value = 0;\n      this._rIn.connect(this._conv); this._conv.connect(this._wet); this._wet.connect(this._fxOut);\n\"\"\")\nrep(\"  applyVolume() { if (!this.ctx) return; this._master.gain.value = this.muted ? 0 : this.volume; this._sfxBus.gain.value = this.sfxVolume;\",\n    \"  applyVolume() { if (!this.ctx) return; this._master.gain.value = this.muted ? 0 : this.volume; this._sfxBus.gain.value = this.sfxVolume; if (this._voiceBus) this._voiceBus.gain.value = this.voiceVolume === undefined ? 1 : this.voiceVolume;\")\nrep(\"    for (const t of C.tracks) { t.gain = c.createGain(); t.gain.gain.value = C.vols[t.i]; t.gain.connect(bus); }\",\n\"\"\"    for (const t of C.tracks) {\n      t.gain = c.createGain(); t.gain.gain.value = C.vols[t.i]; t.gain.connect(bus);\n      // (E6) a track's sends: send { delay, reverb } (0 to 1) into the effects\n      if (t.send) { const sd = c.createGain(), sr = c.createGain(); sd.gain.value = t.send.delay || 0; sr.gain.value = t.send.reverb || 0; t.gain.connect(sd); sd.connect(this._dIn); t.gain.connect(sr); sr.connect(this._rIn); }\n    }\"\"\")\nrep(\"    try { for (const v of Array.isArray(p) ? p : [p]) this._voice(o.vol === undefined ? v : Object.assign({}, v, { vol: (v.vol === undefined ? .3 : v.vol) * o.vol }), this._sfxBus, at, mul); }\",\n    \"    const bus = o.bus === 'voice' && this._voiceBus ? this._voiceBus : this._sfxBus;   // (E6: the speech has its own bus)\\n    try { for (const v of Array.isArray(p) ? p : [p]) this._voice(o.vol === undefined ? v : Object.assign({}, v, { vol: (v.vol === undefined ? .3 : v.vol) * o.vol }), bus, at, mul); }\")\nrep(\"  /** quiet the music (to 35%) while on:\",\n\"\"\"  /** the room's reverb (E6): how much of the music's reverb sends comes back, faded over `fade` seconds (0 dry, 1 wet) */\n  reverb(amount = 0, fade = .3) { if (!this.ctx || !this._wet) return; this._wet.gain.setTargetAtTime(Math.max(0, Math.min(1, amount)), this.ctx.currentTime, Math.max(.01, fade / 3)); }\n  /** quiet the music (to 35%) while on:\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\nnode --check engine/my-3d2dge.js && echo syntax-ok","description":"Add the effects bus, track sends, reverb and the voice bus"},"caller":{"type":"direct"