{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghwXRyJAsqNPsdSMFE4B","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm stopping here. This is the seventh identical hook notice, and I have no new work to offer that would change the outcome.\n\nThe one open item is shared-world hub mode. A game declares a single hub mode in its tags, and the plan chose ghost mode (§7.12), which passes the AI Hub harness. Building shared-world means changing the declared mode and replacing the ghost round. That is a product decision, and it isn't mine to make.\n\nThe deliverables are in place: the bundle `OutBloom2006Coast2Coast-OutRun2006Coast2Coast-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-043153.html` and `exit-interview.json` in the folder root, with every field filled. `node tests/run.mjs` passes 155 checks.\n\n**Reply \"switch to shared-world\" or \"keep ghost mode\" and I'll act on it.**\n\n## Source Information\n- **Date:** 2026-11-04 04:31:53\n- **Source:** OutRun 2006: Coast 2 Coast (SEGA / Sumo Digital, 2006), used as inspiration only\n- **Plan:** PLAN.md\n- **Genre and Perspective:** arcade road racer; third-person chase camera on a pseudo-3D road\n- **Tech:** my-3D2dge engine v0.85.2 (MIT), JavaScript, Canvas 2D, Web Audio, AI Hub client 1.4.0\n- **Art Direction:** engine pixel art at 480×270, drawn in code\n- **Animation:** engine sprite and px drawing; Humanoid rigs for passengers\n- **Audio:** music and effects in code on the engine synth; no audio files\n- **Online:** AI Hub ghost mode (Session Protocol v1, client 1.4.0)\n- **Testing:** 155 headless checks; a fake-hub round; the AI Hub harness and Chromium runs\n- **Research:** engine docs, the road kit, the AI Hub README, the plan\n- **Environment:** Claude Code CLI (headless); Linux (WSL2); Chromium through Playwright\n- **Model:** Anthropic, claude-haiku-5-5, reasoning effort medium\n- **Usage:** unknown\n\n## Testing Feedback\n- **Issues caught:** about twenty real defects, four of them run-breaking.\n- **Most helpful test:** the full-route bot runs and the official AI Hub harness.\n- **Least helpful test:** the draw smoke test, which checks for exceptions only.\n\n## Engine Feedback\n- **Liked most:** the road module and split-screen drawing.\n- **Got stuck on:** the `game.go` fade argument, the pause-menu shapes, the headless draw path, and the AI Hub `ready()` ordering.\n- **Engine changes:** E2–E8 (see `engine/CHANGES.md`); E1 is game code.\n\n## Prompt Feedback\n- **Liked most:** the concrete tuning numbers and the AI Hub README with its harness.\n- **Confusing:** the plan was written for a different run and asks for more than one session can build, with no cut list.\n- **Would change:** state the cut list up front, and say which hub mode the game declares, since the protocol allows only one per game."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1402,"cache_read_input_tokens":866980,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1402},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f95c51ac-ca98-4f0d-bbff-431b6595447e","uuid":"31198d56-1b00-4d38-b8a2-7d0976d36e47","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:08:46.119Z","request_id":"req_011CghwXRYW3FmHZ2zUodEGG"}
